{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ddff19613d4237f791f526842abba61b2160015acaf23dfae5664f968c98cd60", "ja": "泊りがけのPV撮影も無事終了、あとは帰るだけだな。\nハードな日程だったけど、よく頑張ったな、やよい。", "zh": "需要过夜拍摄的PV也顺利结束，再来只剩回去了。\n行程虽然很紧凑，但你撑过去了呢，弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "0fe11c4d81d4bb992f46b8e4aac2efe8f15281bc161f96be4f67155868e772c8", "ja": "お疲れ様でした！\n楽しすぎて、あっという間でした。えへへ♪", "zh": "辛苦你了！\n过程太开心，时间一下就过去了呢，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0ede1054389f64b9b861bf3a4c174f20cb687047cdb4be2fcd0543a514d48255", "ja": "あのスケジュールをこなして、まだ元気いっぱいだな…\nさすがというか何というか、すごく頼もしいよ。", "zh": "完成如此紧凑的行程后，居然还这么有活力……\n我都不晓得该怎么佩服你了，真是可靠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1003_p", "source_sha256": "170b3b366ced1bab57544f0234ec7560c9110182afeab5577dc7efb106dab63d", "ja": "撮影現場の雰囲気も和やかだったし、やよいの\nおかげだって、スタッフさん達みんな褒めてたぞ！", "zh": "拍摄现场的氛围也很和睦，\n工作人员们都夸说是弥生的功劳喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "740134dc2e6a4bd25e3a9dfc21fdbba6781fc5c1b5eb5ef660d4e0e92abdd44e", "ja": "そうなんですか？　でも私、ふつうに撮ってもらってた\nだけで、なんにもしてませんけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？但我只是单纯出现在镜头前，\n并没有特别做什么呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "5f1f0d46975da4b530313bf25b34e2e84481cffb8609f23b1d4b03982cb1a792", "ja": "あ、休憩時間に、コイにエサをあげました！\n……でも、そのぐらいですよ？", "zh": "啊，我在休息时有去喂鲤鱼！\n……但也只是这样而已耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f55160e0f2d9752471809eb25c269fbde2f0a97a77ae36c3c23741ac536d8e6e", "ja": "そういう自然な姿勢が良かったんだと思うよ。\nとにかく、お疲れ様！", "zh": "我想原因就在于你可以这样自然不做作。\n总之辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a2c8f6ac6b72edc8ba5365b17e03e3111beea8a3c04215b6f8dfede21958a123", "ja": "順調に進んだおかげで、一番いい紅葉を撮ることが\nできた。最高のPVになりそうだ！", "zh": "托拍摄顺利的福，我们也拍到了最美的枫叶。\n感觉会是最棒的PV呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "733b434bcaf10858715ac27cf88760148bd0277befdabc696b4aa6cea756e6aa", "ja": "一番いいもみじ！\nえへへ、よかったです～。", "zh": "最美的枫叶！\n嘿嘿，太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "230e2f5e4a5395627c81ca2612f543c9d2dbd4f6f4d35fca0bab8c51b25d441d", "ja": "なんだか今回のお仕事は、すっごくゼイタクでした！\n伊織ちゃんとお泊りできて、ごはんもおいしくて。", "zh": "感觉这次的工作真的好奢侈！\n可以和伊织一起过夜，饭菜也很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "6e188a9ace93d42ff34c3366dffb29536df4137d83913d757b60b1256a004acc", "ja": "一番いいもみじが見れて、お仕事もうまくいって！", "zh": "还看到了最美的枫叶，工作也非常顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "53eebcd887104b94bf8381ba325b4156aa524d59f674d1c65d8026b24e361a4f", "ja": "えへへっ、いっぱいゼイタクしちゃった分、\n戻ったら、もっといっぱい頑張らなくちゃですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，有这么多奢侈享受，\n回去以后要更努力才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ac5c1139abca0f2215c40f63ff941ac92c0ab460ebc0ffe643423fc0c31da138", "ja": "それはいいけど、別にやよいはゼイタクしてないぞ？\n宿も弁当も普通のところだし。", "zh": "你有这份心是很好，但弥生也没有特别奢侈喔。\n住宿跟便当都是一般水准而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "b0887a7d84ecab46ba9a6539f61495c1fac61c0e4bdd9d58feddb4f93ccfee10", "ja": "でも、私が家に帰ったら、きっと留守番してた弟たちに\n「お姉ちゃんばっかりズルい！」って言われますー。", "zh": "可是等我回到家，看家的弟弟们肯定会说\n「只有姊姊可以这样，太狡猾了！」啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b88e08e310d88d329c1b9dc5e47301887c439727dc93176ca45d1ffe27a76213", "ja": "はは、ズルくないから大丈夫だよ。\nやよいは遊びじゃなくて、仕事で来たんだからな。", "zh": "哈哈，一点也不狡猾，没事啦。\n毕竟弥生是来工作，不是来玩的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "ba16fe43eefed1afb5493593f14ea206071391f24e68171dd53985410782b780", "ja": "そ……そうですか？\nそれなら、いいんですけど……。", "zh": "真……真的吗？\n那我就放心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "488a2ef17191a8e59a3c272286a8a8d7378d6a12826093667d278f93a9953562", "ja": "あっ！　やっぱりダメです！\n私、いっぱい遊んじゃいました～！", "zh": "啊！仔细想想还是不行！\n我其实玩得很开心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "439c73662835911a0909a7107b891aab67ba2a6114066e945ce0dea1217d4a79", "ja": "えっ？　いや、そんなはず……？", "zh": "咦？没有这回事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "a737803c3ff5ae34fa470c15cb77bf67acc2982be013f850981d63644f6b0580", "ja": "池のコイに、いっぱいごはんあげちゃいました～！\nうう、お仕事じゃないのにごめんなさい～！", "zh": "池塘的鲤鱼，我喂牠们吃了好多饭～！\n呜呜，对不起我做了不是工作的事情～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "12a38ebea6e967e87a9ef7cad7fe0b0c054f01ce5c4f477ab76be4f54206d277", "ja": "な、なるほど……。よし、それじゃ弟さん達には、\nお土産をあげることにしようか。きっと喜ばれるぞ！", "zh": "原、原来如此……那么，你就带些伴手礼\n回去给弟弟们吧，他们一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "a9cbd0f0f6693626fce60c8ee70d8f85e9313b2fd6baab3ed38259a0364ea152", "ja": "おみやげ……。", "zh": "伴手礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "8102a32fe78f3c3d743be3919da953c2192e25ae8145b8b93cde237cb48745f5", "ja": "{$P$}、それって……\nばいしゅうっていう……？", "zh": "{$P$}，这样……\n不就是用礼物贿赂吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e6c93724086117455abc191475ade2a632e7b1e46c1c5718b4c6c9507d92d434", "ja": "いやいや。お土産は、旅の思い出のおすそ分けなんだ。\nやよいの場合、ゼイタクのおすそ分けかな？", "zh": "不是喔，伴手礼是将旅行的回忆带回去分给别人。\n以弥生来说，就是分享你刚才说的奢侈吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "4fb4848cb2d7dc2f5aa89d0df81363ebb70af5c85b6df61057418dcf69649f9c", "ja": "おすそ分け！　おすそ分けは大事ですよねっ。\nやっぱりいいことは、みんなで分けなくちゃ。", "zh": "分享！分享是很重要的呢！\n遇上好事果然就应该和大家一起分享。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "402d722540cbacd5672018dcc57b33c30da3a9bd15ecd2fd9253b68b5772065e", "ja": "わかりました！　私、お土産を持って帰ります！\nあ、でも、なにがいいかな～？", "zh": "我知道了！我要带伴手礼回去！\n啊，可是要带什么才好呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d6c739baa4edfa58e0bc5ad19c04b7f290d3e7c2031c587e0ec113c5e384f962", "ja": "そうだな。たとえばほら、\nその辺りにたくさんある、赤い……", "zh": "我想想……\n比方说那边一整片红通通的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "f62e1d5c55468793fa78c5fba4285be164d098517a7672adebf022e1274b2a27", "ja": "あっ！　わかりました！", "zh": "啊！我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "f68b22014a5990d3776b4c75f3f59b47d6ae0648afc1496b387984b33f5058c5", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\n私、ゼイタクのおすそ分け、いっぱい集めますねっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n我要收集好多奢侈带回去分享！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1028_p", "source_sha256": "98a8261a905af4d332f1afafffbaf69fd377334c2076742e79e281d1db3a0376", "ja": "（やよいは嬉しそうに、もみじを集めに行った。\n心のおすそ分けは、きっと伝わるだろう）", "zh": "（弥生兴高采烈地去收集枫叶了。\n我想她的喜悦一定能传递出去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0084_1029_p", "source_sha256": "015b15932819315b3d805b11b9082136fbc9fdb43e0bc464eb5e4c86fdc6a097", "ja": "（さて、俺は俺で、買い物に行かないと。\n大人向けのおすそ分けを集めに……！）", "zh": "（那我也差不多该去购物了，\n去收集要分享给大人的奢侈……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
